{"title":"Dwarf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Human that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dwarf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dwarf?lv=1\">Lv 1</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dwarf?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>104</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dwarf?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dwarf?lv=1\" title=\"Pick level 1\"><td><b>1</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>12</td><td>1.5</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 2.1 · 150</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dwarf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>30</b></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>104</td><td>in the wilds around -301, -1029</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dwarf?lv=40\" title=\"Pick level 40\"><td><b>40</b></td><td>194</td><td>26.5</td><td>2,000</td><td class=\"muted\">582 · 37.1 · 6,000</td><td>1</td><td>in the wilds around -261, -1021</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dwarf\" data-map-level=\"30\">Show level 30 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-2022.4px,1811.3px)\"><i style=\"left:2090.0px;top:-1761.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1982.9px;top:-1826.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:2062.5px;top:-1832.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:2032.3px;top:-1878.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:2007.5px;top:-1758.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:2059.8px;top:-1738.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1922.1px;top:-1883.8px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -291, -1027 <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -113, -760 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -662, -482 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around -556, -369 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dwarf\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(26)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/dwarf-envoy\"><img src=\"data/img/82f2f368b69ecec68fbb.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Dwarf Envoy</b><span>Lv 30</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/fisher\"><img src=\"data/img/82f2f368b69ecec68fbb.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Fisher</b><span>Lv 30</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/bodvar\"><img src=\"data/img/82f2f368b69ecec68fbb.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Bodvar</b><span>Lv 30</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/hakon\"><img src=\"data/img/8